Description: PiVista - turn any HDMI monitor into a smart TV
 Full-screen 10-foot TV interface for Raspberry Pi 4 with YouTube, Netflix,
 HBO Max and Disney+, a native 4K video player, and a phone remote at
 http://pivista.local paired by scanning an on-screen dot pattern.
